        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 736.26,
          "end": 736.42,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " morning",
          "start": 736.7,
          "end": 736.88,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " prayer.",
          "start": 736.88,
          "end": 737.28,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"And similarly, you find the word Elohim, which means God, 19 times, in the pericope of the Ve-\u2019elleh shemot.",
      "start": 737.8,
      "end": 745.08,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \"And",
