        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, in Sura 7, verse 143, God says \"I gathered all of you, all the descendants of Adam, and I had you bear witness that I alone am your Lord.\"",
      "start": 1441.88,
      "end": 1450.38,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
