        },
        {
          "word": " Lord.\"",
          "start": 1450.06,
          "end": 1450.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "God tells us that.",
      "start": 1451.04,
      "end": 1452.05,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 1451.04,
          "end": 1451.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " tells",
          "start": 1451.1,
          "end": 1451.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " us",
          "start": 1451.32,
          "end": 1451.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " that.",
          "start": 1451.5,
          "end": 1452.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But we don't have any recollection of this. We don't remember standing before God and saying \"we bear witness You are our Lord.\"",
      "start": 1452.54,
      "end": 1458.18,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
